release: 5.5.0
tags: $:/tags/ChangeNote
title: $:/changenotes/5.5.0/#9845
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* New `static-tabs` macro renders a tab set as static HTML that works without JavaScript, using collapsible `details` elements by default, or `sections`
* Static renders also import tiddlers tagged `$:/tags/Global/Static`, so they can replace an interactive macro there only; the core uses this to render `tabs` as `static-tabs`
